      <description><![CDATA[
<p>Mac only; no iPhone/iPad release (the Unreleased entry above ships with the next companion release).</p>
<h3>Added</h3>
<ul><li>A Codex account over its usage limit shows as Codex at 100 % with the reset time from Codex's message (rings, sidebar footer, red dot, <code>cmds agents</code>, schedules waiting for Codex's limit), until the reset passes or newer figures arrive. The last known Codex limits are kept across relaunches, and limits are also picked up from recent Codex sessions not running in a pane (<code>codex exec</code>, <code>codex review</code>) (#227).</li></ul>
      ]]></description>
